---
# The documentation shows the tutorial sources in code blocks, which fit
# 71 columns without scrolling in a 1300 px wide window. The root style
# lets a line overflow by a few characters and almost never breaks after
# "=": both penalties are changed so that the limit holds and long
# right-hand sides move to the next line. Comments are not reflowed, so
# that ASCII diagrams stay intact: wrap long comments by hand.
BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig
ColumnLimit: 71
PenaltyBreakAssignment: 10
PenaltyExcessCharacter: 1000
ReflowComments: false
